      { prompt: "After “De una”, what does “cuadramos la hora mañana” leave open?", choices: ["Whether Alex wants to go at all.", "Only the exact time for meeting.", "Whether Santiago knows Alex well."], answer: 1, tests: "commitment versus logistics in plans" }
